Description:
BIONA is an innovative ecosystem for personalized medicine that unites three unique development pillars on a single platform:
	•	Manufacturing of next-generation, first-in-class targeted gene therapies and high-tech mRNA therapeutics;
	•	Establishment of the Human Regeneration Center, built on the team’s proprietary scientific discoveries in organ regeneration and life extension;
	•	Development of a unified AI-powered bioinformatics platform to enable interdisciplinary integration of cutting-edge digital and biomedical technologies, scientific research, and social, educational, and philanthropic initiatives.

Our mission is to make healthy longevity a norm for every person's life.
